{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27301","headline":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 三 · 裴潾","name":"前相国赞皇公早葺平泉山居蹔还憩旋起赴诏命作镇浙右輙抒怀赋四言诗十四首奉寄 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"历难求试，执宪成风。\n四镇咸乂，三阶以融。\n捧日柱天，造膝纳忠。\n建储固本，树屏息戎。\n彼狐彼鼠，窒穴扫踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴潾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}